	(text "U4: DP_CE_N low for RD/WR in 0x3000-0x37DF (0x37FF with FULL jumper).\n     Qualified by MEMQ (no I/O cycle). Pin 22 spare.\nU5: IORD / IOWR high for IN / OUT on ports 0x50-0x53 (0x70-0x73 with ALT jumper).\n     A1:A0 go to the FPGA: 0 APU data, 1 APU cmd/status, 2 GFX data, 3 GFX cmd/status."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 185.42 0)
		(effects
