	(text "U2: Z80 memory cycles to the DPRAM (A->B = write, RD_N low = read).\nU3: Z80 I/O cycles to the FPGA ports (APU + sprite engine); FPGA enables it via PORT_OE_N\n     only after parking its own DPRAM access (shared XD bus)."
