	(text "Header pins 1-4 (P36-P39) are used by the module's own TF card slot.\nP79-P86 are the 1.8V bank: only to J4, never to 3.3V/5V logic.\nP70-P75 (PORT_OE_N, R_CE_N, R_RW_N, WAIT/INT_DRV): confirm 3.3V bank\non the Sipeed schematic before assembly.\nModule +3V3 output powers the board's 3.3V logic (no second regulator)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 650.24 144.78 0)
		(effects
