	(text "MEMORY MAP (Z80 side, IDT7132 left port)\n  0x3000-0x33FF  FRAME BUFFER  1024 bytes = 64x16, sprite engine output, LDIR to 0x3C00\n  0x3400-0x37DF  bulk data area (sprite shapes, tile maps, APU vectors)\n  0x37E0-0x37FF  Expansion Interface (not decoded unless FULL jumper)\n\nI/O MAP  (block 0x50-0x53, or 0x70-0x73 with PORT ALT)\n  0x50  Am9511 data\n  0x51  Am9511 command (OUT) / status (IN)\n  0x52  sprite engine parameter (OUT) / result (IN)\n  0x53  sprite engine command (OUT) / status (IN)\n\nALL PARTS THROUGH-HOLE. Socket U1, U4, U5 and the Tang Nano 9K.\nVERIFY: IDT7132 DIP-48 pinout against the datasheet before ordering PCBs."
